WEBVTT

00:05.560 --> 00:08.270
Daddy, may I have a piece of candy?

00:08.270 --> 00:10.240
This is the last one.

00:10.240 --> 00:11.570
'Kay!

00:18.870 --> 00:20.700
You okay?

00:20.700 --> 00:23.330
My butt hurts!

00:23.330 --> 00:25.330
We're almost there.

00:25.330 --> 00:29.420
But what if some magical beasts attack?

00:29.420 --> 00:32.590
Don't worry. The mercenaries
and witches will take care of them.

00:32.590 --> 00:34.220
Yeah, you're right!

00:40.100 --> 00:43.140
We've arrived, ladies and gentlemen.

00:43.140 --> 00:45.400
This is the start of our new life!

01:04.290 --> 01:05.620
Here you go.

01:07.920 --> 01:09.210
Thanks, come again!

01:11.840 --> 01:13.670
May I get one, as well?

01:13.670 --> 01:14.880
Sure thing.

01:19.100 --> 01:22.270
Don't think I've seen you before.
You from out of town, miss?

01:22.270 --> 01:24.140
Yes. From Bristol.

01:24.140 --> 01:27.900
Bristol, eh? That must've been quite the trip.

01:27.900 --> 01:30.570
I was asleep, so it felt like mere moments.

01:30.570 --> 01:32.610
Here you are.

01:32.610 --> 01:34.990
Oh, I need to pay you.
Hold it right there!

01:34.990 --> 01:37.990
You're a cute gal, so it's on the house.

01:37.990 --> 01:39.240
Huh? But...

01:39.240 --> 01:41.910
Allow me to officially
welcome you to Malmcester!

01:46.580 --> 01:47.540
Yummy.

01:47.540 --> 01:50.790
What do you think you're doing?!

01:49.720 --> 01:50.790
Sorry!

02:08.850 --> 02:10.100
Poor little thing.

02:11.650 --> 02:15.820
Oh, sorry. I was about to
take that out since it wilted.

02:15.820 --> 02:16.900
Oh, it's okay.

02:21.280 --> 02:24.830
Wow, that's amazing.

02:24.830 --> 02:27.710
I just gave it some of my energy.

02:27.710 --> 02:29.830
Are you a witch?

02:29.830 --> 02:31.880
I'm just an apprentice still.

02:31.880 --> 02:34.090
Oh, do you go to that school, then?

02:34.090 --> 02:36.840
I'm actually about to knock
on their door right now.

03:08.200 --> 03:10.000
Welcome.

03:10.000 --> 03:12.460
Oh, hi. My name is Tiara.

03:12.460 --> 03:13.880
Please, come this way.

03:13.880 --> 03:16.380
Um, I wanted to go to this school...

03:16.380 --> 03:17.760
This way, please.

03:17.760 --> 03:20.680
Um... Okay.

03:26.180 --> 03:28.600
Welcome to Flora Girls' Academy.

03:28.600 --> 03:32.480
I'm the school's director, Chloe.
Tiara-san, was it?

03:32.480 --> 03:37.900
Yeah, I... I mean, yes. I was hoping
you'd allow me to study at this school—

03:37.900 --> 03:39.940
Very well.

03:39.210 --> 03:39.940
Huh?

03:39.940 --> 03:42.320
I will allow you to attend this academy.

03:42.320 --> 03:44.990
Um, isn't there an exam, or...?

03:46.530 --> 03:48.450
Well, let's see...

03:48.450 --> 03:52.040
Then if you would take a moment
to touch that stone.

03:52.040 --> 03:55.080
It can tell if you have
what it takes to be a witch or not.

04:04.180 --> 04:09.180
The doors of this academy are open
to all that have a bright future.

04:09.180 --> 04:10.640
Thank you very much!

04:12.980 --> 04:14.850
Give light to the stars,

04:14.850 --> 04:17.060
bless the earth...

04:15.470 --> 04:17.060
—earth...

04:17.060 --> 04:20.150
and give thanks to
the Witch of Dawn, Flora.

04:24.490 --> 04:26.410
Come in.

04:26.410 --> 04:27.910
Pardon me.

04:29.200 --> 04:30.620
Huh? Rose?!

04:31.870 --> 04:33.960
Tiara-sama!

04:32.700 --> 04:33.960
I've missed you!

04:33.960 --> 04:36.290
I missed you so much, Rosetta!

04:37.590 --> 04:39.880
I missed you, too, Tiara-sama.

04:39.880 --> 04:43.510
I heard you were going to this school,
but I didn't think I'd see you so quickly!

04:43.510 --> 04:47.890
Please show Tiara-san around the campus.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.140
As you wish.

04:49.140 --> 04:53.640
Also, please welcome
Tiara-san into your group.

04:53.640 --> 04:55.600
Huh? But that's—

04:55.600 --> 04:59.150
This is not a suggestion.
It has already been decided.

05:00.820 --> 05:02.030
Yes, ma'am.

05:06.660 --> 05:08.870
It's been so long, hasn't it?

05:08.870 --> 05:11.290
The last time we saw each other was...

05:11.290 --> 05:13.960
Two years, three months, and 14 days.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.460
Of course, you'd know that.

05:19.290 --> 05:21.300
What a lovely courtyard.

05:21.300 --> 05:24.970
Yes. It's the perfect place to take a break.

05:24.970 --> 05:27.300
Yeah, it seems like it.

05:27.300 --> 05:29.970
Why did you decide to attend
this academy, Tiara-sama?

05:33.220 --> 05:36.520
Hey, why do you keep speaking so formally to me?

05:36.520 --> 05:37.600
That's because—

05:37.600 --> 05:40.900
We're both students here.
It's weird for you to use "sama."

05:40.900 --> 05:43.820
Not to mention, you're my senior.

05:43.820 --> 05:45.280
But Tiara-sama—

05:45.280 --> 05:50.870
If you're going to keep that up,
I'll just have to call you Rosetta-senpai.

05:50.870 --> 05:57.250
As you wish—Ahem. Oh, all right, Tiara.

05:59.040 --> 06:00.590
Well, let's go.

06:00.590 --> 06:06.380
Oh, what are these groups that
the director was talking about?

06:06.380 --> 06:09.590
A lot of the students here
join groups to help each other out,

06:09.590 --> 06:11.850
since it's a lot harder working on your own.

06:11.850 --> 06:15.430
So I get to be in the same group as you?

06:15.430 --> 06:17.850
Who else is in our group?

06:17.850 --> 06:19.730
I'll introduce you to them right now.

06:20.860 --> 06:25.360
Um, hi. I'm Lynette.
It's a pleasure to meet you!

06:25.360 --> 06:27.110
Likewise.

06:27.110 --> 06:30.570
Are you sure you want to be
in the same group as us?

06:30.570 --> 06:32.530
That was the director's decision.

06:32.530 --> 06:36.050
The director's? That's strange.

06:36.050 --> 06:40.170
That's usually up to the student...

06:38.660 --> 06:40.170
It bit me!

06:40.170 --> 06:41.710
Yes.

06:40.520 --> 06:41.710
What are you doing, Lily?!

06:41.710 --> 06:43.130
Get it off me!

06:46.590 --> 06:49.800
Wow, there are so many books here.

06:49.800 --> 06:52.680
There are! This library is absolutely amazing!

06:52.680 --> 06:56.890
There are people who come from
faraway for the books here!

06:56.890 --> 07:00.140
Ehhh. You must really love books...

07:00.140 --> 07:03.810
I love reading stories oh so much!

07:03.810 --> 07:07.440
These books all seem really difficult to read.

07:14.530 --> 07:18.790
"Now, let us set sail upon
the true ocean called love..."

07:18.790 --> 07:20.790
No! You've got the wrong idea!

07:20.790 --> 07:24.250
Please forget that you ever saw this!
Cast those memories into oblivion!

07:25.420 --> 07:30.720
As you all know, the essence of magic
lies with pyroxenes.

07:30.720 --> 07:32.970
Pyroxenes are the crystallized form
of pyrosand. In order to...

07:33.050 --> 07:35.180
There are all kinds of classes,

07:35.180 --> 07:37.600
but students are free
to choose the ones they want.

07:37.600 --> 07:40.560
Wow, you can choose?

07:44.020 --> 07:45.820
Okay, Champe.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.530
Leave it to me.

07:47.530 --> 07:49.280
Slowly, slowly...

07:52.150 --> 07:56.200
There are plenty of classes and exams
that require groups of people.

07:56.200 --> 07:59.250
So that must be when we work
with our groups.

08:01.460 --> 08:03.330
She's flying!

08:03.330 --> 08:07.590
You can make those discs float
by filling them with mana.

08:07.590 --> 08:09.630
How do you steer them?

08:09.630 --> 08:13.840
It's technically all about balance...
but it's not as easy as it sounds.

08:09.630 --> 08:11.970
What are you doing, Luci?!

08:11.970 --> 08:13.840
Like it's my fault!

08:13.840 --> 08:16.180
You're the one who was zoning out!

08:18.510 --> 08:20.060
There they are.

08:20.060 --> 08:21.100
The other members of our group?

08:21.100 --> 08:22.640
Yes.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.150
Fwoosh!

08:24.150 --> 08:26.400
The blonde girl who just
dodged the ball is Lavie.

08:27.730 --> 08:29.820
The girl who just caught it is Ashley.

08:29.820 --> 08:33.530
Now with you here,
we have five members in our group.

08:33.530 --> 08:35.450
They're both really good.

08:43.460 --> 08:45.790
That's 15 to 7, so game set.

08:48.500 --> 08:50.340
You guys were watching?

08:49.630 --> 08:50.340
Yes.

08:50.340 --> 08:53.550
Wasn't that last super shot just amazing?

08:53.550 --> 08:55.840
That was all thanks to my pass.

08:55.840 --> 08:59.930
Nah, no way. Even Tom
could've pulled off a pass like that.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.270
Now for some introductions.

09:01.270 --> 09:05.020
This is a new student
who'll be joining our group...

09:05.020 --> 09:07.350
I'm Tiara. Nice to meet you.

09:07.350 --> 09:08.770
I'm Ashley.

09:08.770 --> 09:12.030
I'm Lavie, this academy's ace!

09:12.030 --> 09:15.200
Self-proclaimed ace.
Wait, you're joining our group?!

09:15.200 --> 09:18.030
Are you sure?

09:15.950 --> 09:18.030
Yes, I'd love to.

09:18.030 --> 09:20.450
Heck yeah! I love you lots!

09:20.450 --> 09:24.660
That's a relief. You actually seem
astute unlike someone else I know.

09:24.660 --> 09:28.580
Hey, are you talking about me?
And what the heck does astute mean?!

09:28.580 --> 09:30.420
Are you telling me you don't know?

09:30.420 --> 09:37.890
Uh... Of course, I do!
Astute, right? So basically...

09:38.800 --> 09:44.100
So it means... Is it something like a newt?

09:44.100 --> 09:46.640
Are you absolutely positive that you want
to be in the same group as her?

09:47.900 --> 09:49.310
Oh, yeah!

09:49.310 --> 09:53.320
Since we're going to be friends,
I'll introduce you to some of my friends, too,

09:53.320 --> 09:55.570
Tiara-chan!

09:54.350 --> 09:55.570
—chan?!

09:59.820 --> 10:01.370
They're so cute!

10:01.370 --> 10:04.660
I know, right? Their names are Tom and Sherry.

10:04.660 --> 10:06.370
Though they're both female.

10:06.370 --> 10:08.370
Wait, is that weird?

10:11.500 --> 10:16.260
They're the best of friends
since they grew up together.

10:16.260 --> 10:18.680
They're basically childhood friends.

10:18.680 --> 10:20.640
Then they're just like Rosetta and me.

10:20.640 --> 10:21.930
Oh, really?

10:21.930 --> 10:25.180
We hadn't seen each other in forever,
though. It's been two years...

10:25.180 --> 10:27.020
...three months, and 14 days.

10:35.400 --> 10:38.280
You're supposed to hit
as many targets as you can.

10:38.280 --> 10:40.200
That seems like a lot of fun.

10:41.700 --> 10:42.870
Excellent.

10:43.870 --> 10:44.870
Next!

10:51.040 --> 10:53.040
This is a class on metallization magic.

10:51.040 --> 10:53.040
You're too soft! Concentrate!

10:53.040 --> 10:55.000
That seems hard.

11:00.220 --> 11:02.470
So this is the pool.

11:02.470 --> 11:04.600
Yeah. I figured that out.

11:06.310 --> 11:07.600
So close!

11:07.600 --> 11:13.310
That's too bad. All right, next!

11:07.600 --> 11:10.900
They're using magical arrows.
It's harder than it looks.

11:10.900 --> 11:13.310
You need ample mana,
concentration, not to mention,

11:13.310 --> 11:16.150
a strong core and muscles to pull this off.

11:16.150 --> 11:18.240
I don't think I can do it...

11:25.910 --> 11:29.040
Oh, dear. That's minus two points.

11:25.910 --> 11:29.040
Hey, isn't it dangerous being this close?

11:29.040 --> 11:32.790
You don't need to worry about that.
There's a barrier that holds in the flame.

11:32.790 --> 11:35.290
All right, next person.

11:32.790 --> 11:33.920
Ehhh.

11:33.920 --> 11:36.250
So when that arrow hits the target...

11:36.250 --> 11:39.550
Hang on a second. Did you just say flame?

11:44.220 --> 11:46.560
...it's set to explode.

11:46.560 --> 11:49.730
You can basically take out
a magical beast in one blow.

11:51.850 --> 11:52.850
Tiara?

11:56.270 --> 11:58.980
What's the matter, Tiara?! Tiara!

11:58.980 --> 12:01.450
Tia!

12:02.250 --> 12:07.580
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

12:02.250 --> 12:07.580
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

12:07.580 --> 12:12.080
Seven colours are not enough

12:07.580 --> 12:12.080
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

12:12.080 --> 12:17.750
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

12:12.080 --> 12:15.080
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

12:15.080 --> 12:17.750
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

12:17.750 --> 12:23.750
The story is going beyond

12:17.750 --> 12:23.750
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

12:27.920 --> 12:33.250
The bell toll in my heart

12:27.920 --> 12:33.250
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

12:33.250 --> 12:37.580
is getting louder bit by bit

12:33.250 --> 12:37.580
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

12:37.580 --> 12:41.080
Believe in the excitement

12:37.580 --> 12:41.080
sono takanari wo shinjite

12:41.080 --> 12:43.580
And take one step forward

12:41.080 --> 12:43.580
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

12:43.580 --> 12:50.910
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

12:43.580 --> 12:50.910
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

12:49.250 --> 12:51.910
Can't be for sure

12:49.250 --> 12:51.910
zettai nante nai

12:50.910 --> 12:53.580
Nothing

12:50.910 --> 12:53.580
nanimo

12:51.910 --> 12:54.580
There's no guarantee

12:51.910 --> 12:54.580
kakushin wa dekinai

12:53.580 --> 12:56.250
No one

12:53.580 --> 12:56.250
daremo

12:54.580 --> 12:57.250
But I won't give up

12:54.580 --> 12:57.250
demo akiramenai

12:56.250 --> 12:58.910
That's why

12:56.250 --> 12:58.910
dakara

12:57.250 --> 12:59.410
I can still move forward

12:57.250 --> 12:59.410
susundeku koto ga

12:59.240 --> 13:00.750
I can still move forward

12:59.240 --> 13:00.750
dekiru yo

13:00.750 --> 13:06.580
Because there's magic right in here

13:00.750 --> 13:06.580
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

13:06.580 --> 13:12.910
It started to be brighter than the stars

13:06.580 --> 13:12.910
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

13:12.910 --> 13:17.580
I can't stop now

13:12.910 --> 13:17.580
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

13:17.580 --> 13:23.250
It entered into a new era

13:17.580 --> 13:23.250
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

13:23.250 --> 13:27.580
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

13:23.250 --> 13:27.580
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

13:27.580 --> 13:31.250
And go beyond the future

13:27.580 --> 13:31.250
saki no hou e

13:36.170 --> 13:38.920
Tiara, wait!

13:38.920 --> 13:41.960
I've made up my mind!

13:41.960 --> 13:44.630
No. You mustn't go.

13:46.090 --> 13:48.260
Ugh, forget you, Onee-chan!

13:48.260 --> 13:49.640
Tiara!

13:55.890 --> 13:57.850
Tiara-sama!

13:57.850 --> 13:59.860
Thank goodness you're all right.

14:05.610 --> 14:06.740
Where am I?

14:06.740 --> 14:11.030
This is the academy's lounge.
Are you in any pain?

14:11.030 --> 14:14.870
I'm fine now, Rosetta-senpai.

14:16.290 --> 14:18.670
Sorry, Tiara.

14:18.670 --> 14:21.420
As long as you can take the hint.

14:21.420 --> 14:24.880
Why don't we head to our dorms for the day?

14:24.880 --> 14:27.800
Sure! Lead the way, captain!

14:27.800 --> 14:31.430
But before that, we'll need
to get a certain something.

14:31.430 --> 14:32.640
And what's that?

14:34.220 --> 14:36.600
Your uniform.

14:36.600 --> 14:40.600
I'll go ahead and get it for you,
so you can explore upstairs.

15:04.500 --> 15:06.300
It's so pretty.

15:10.900 --> 15:17.160
After the long winter

15:10.900 --> 15:17.160
nagai fuyu wo koete

15:18.160 --> 15:24.140
The next season brings

15:18.160 --> 15:24.140
yagate kuru kisetsu wa

15:24.140 --> 15:28.240
Birds singing songs

15:24.140 --> 15:28.240
kotori ga saezuri

15:28.240 --> 15:31.750
And flowers smelling so sweet

15:28.240 --> 15:31.750
hana wa kaguwashiku

15:31.750 --> 15:38.750
It all flows towards love

15:31.750 --> 15:38.750
ai e to nagareteiku

15:39.720 --> 15:45.350
Oh, guiding light

15:39.720 --> 15:45.350
michibiku hikari wo

15:45.350 --> 15:52.030
Please shine upon us

15:45.350 --> 15:52.030
dou ka bokura wo terashite

16:08.530 --> 16:09.990
You sound as lovely as ever.

16:09.990 --> 16:13.530
You should've said you were
standing there. How embarrassing.

16:13.530 --> 16:16.990
That takes me back. Wasn't that...

16:18.080 --> 16:21.620
Yeah. It's my sister's song.

16:27.290 --> 16:34.590
I was always so sickly, so she'd always
make me feel better with her songs.

16:34.590 --> 16:39.680
Eliza-sama loves you very much
and was always worried about you.

16:39.680 --> 16:43.520
Yeah... Back then, things were still...

16:43.520 --> 16:47.020
Oh, no. It's nothing.

16:47.020 --> 16:52.280
The reason I'm so much better now
is because of my sister's songs.

16:52.280 --> 16:53.400
I'm sure of it.

16:56.570 --> 16:58.450
Yes.

16:58.450 --> 16:59.910
I'm sure it is.

17:08.040 --> 17:09.800
What a nice breeze.

17:28.860 --> 17:30.320
I guess I fell asleep.

17:30.320 --> 17:31.770
You must've been tired from your long trip.

17:31.770 --> 17:34.780
Yeah, the trip was longer than I'd expected.

17:36.570 --> 17:37.610
Thanks.

17:38.990 --> 17:40.410
Flora-sama!

17:48.330 --> 17:49.540
Is that...

17:49.540 --> 17:50.790
It's the cafeteria.

17:50.790 --> 17:53.760
Then we should grab a bite to eat, too!

17:53.760 --> 17:56.340
—Wait—
—And then I said— Whoa, there!

17:56.340 --> 17:57.840
Tiara!

17:57.840 --> 17:59.010
I'm so sorry!

17:59.010 --> 18:01.180
It's dangerous, running like that.

18:01.180 --> 18:02.260
Are you all right?

18:02.260 --> 18:03.890
Yeah.

18:03.890 --> 18:05.270
What's a Lapis doing here?

18:05.270 --> 18:08.480
Yes, I'm very sorry about that. Let's go.

18:08.480 --> 18:10.360
Huh? We can't be here?

18:10.360 --> 18:12.610
Our rank can't come here until later.

18:12.610 --> 18:13.860
Rank?

18:13.860 --> 18:16.030
Hey, you.

18:15.290 --> 18:16.030
Yes?

18:16.030 --> 18:17.950
That hair accessory...

18:17.950 --> 18:21.990
Oh, this? My big sister gave it to me.

18:21.990 --> 18:23.450
Your sister?

18:25.080 --> 18:26.750
Don't tell me you're...

18:26.750 --> 18:27.750
Huh?

18:29.420 --> 18:30.540
Out of my way.

18:32.380 --> 18:34.130
What's gotten into you, Yue-chin?!

18:34.130 --> 18:35.760
Sorry about that.

18:36.630 --> 18:40.010
Wait up, you two!

18:45.970 --> 18:47.270
Not bad.

18:47.270 --> 18:48.060
Indeed.

18:48.060 --> 18:50.100
You look lovely.

18:50.100 --> 18:51.480
Thanks!

18:51.480 --> 18:53.270
Did you pick a room yet?

18:53.270 --> 18:57.070
Not yet... And this is a four-person room.

18:57.070 --> 19:00.200
I do believe the corner room
nearby is currently vacant.

19:00.200 --> 19:02.870
But that's a room for two.

19:02.870 --> 19:06.660
Well, individual rooms are super popular
and there probably aren't any left, so why not?

19:06.660 --> 19:10.250
But is it okay for me to use
a two-person room on my own?

19:10.250 --> 19:11.670
Good point...

19:11.670 --> 19:14.750
Requesting it might prove difficult.

19:15.880 --> 19:18.920
It wouldn't be fair to leave Tiara-chan all alone...

19:18.920 --> 19:20.550
So it's all up to you...

19:20.550 --> 19:21.890
...Rose-chan!

19:21.890 --> 19:24.850
Me? Wait, are you sure?

19:24.850 --> 19:26.470
Of course.

19:26.470 --> 19:28.730
Do what you can for Tiara-san.

19:28.730 --> 19:30.850
That'll give us more room in here, too.

19:32.020 --> 19:33.480
Then...

19:33.480 --> 19:36.230
I still have a lot to learn,
so it'll be a huge help.

19:37.530 --> 19:39.070
My, my...

19:39.070 --> 19:40.990
Well, don't you seem happy.

19:40.990 --> 19:43.450
It's getting hot in here.

19:43.450 --> 19:44.490
It is?

19:44.490 --> 19:47.580
I'll go ahead and put in a request
so you two can use the room immediately.

19:49.580 --> 19:52.000
I don't think it's that hot in here.

19:52.000 --> 19:53.000
It's scorching hot.

19:53.000 --> 19:56.090
What are you people talking about?!

20:00.050 --> 20:01.590
It all looks so yummy!

20:01.590 --> 20:03.640
Well, let's not wait any longer.

20:06.300 --> 20:10.230
Give light to the stars, bless the earth,

20:10.230 --> 20:13.560
and give thanks to the Witch of Dawn, Flora.

20:23.030 --> 20:25.990
The head chef here is top class.

20:25.990 --> 20:29.950
Apparently, Chloe-sensei scouted them
herself from Marseille.

20:29.950 --> 20:32.460
Well, I don't really care,
as long as the grub's good.

20:33.540 --> 20:36.500
You mean if the food is edible.

20:36.500 --> 20:37.710
You say something?

20:37.710 --> 20:39.000
No, nothing at all.

20:39.000 --> 20:41.290
No, you totally said something.

20:41.290 --> 20:41.760
I did not.

20:41.760 --> 20:46.300
By the way, why weren't we allowed
into the cafeteria earlier?

20:41.760 --> 20:42.300
You did.

20:42.300 --> 20:43.380
I did not.

20:43.380 --> 20:44.760
You totally did!

20:46.300 --> 20:48.050
Well...

20:48.050 --> 20:50.970
Well, we're Lapis, meaning we go last.

20:50.970 --> 20:55.480
Lapis? I guess they did mention
that word earlier...

20:55.480 --> 20:57.810
Wait, inconceivable...

20:57.810 --> 20:59.360
Did you not tell her?

21:01.030 --> 21:02.160
Not yet.

21:02.160 --> 21:02.990
What?!

21:02.990 --> 21:04.360
For real?

21:04.360 --> 21:05.950
Unbelievable.

21:11.750 --> 21:15.620
At this school, we're split into three ranks
depending on our academic scores.

21:15.620 --> 21:19.500
They are Noir, Rouge, and Lapis.

21:19.500 --> 21:22.840
The Noir students always get
to eat and use the bath, first.

21:22.840 --> 21:24.170
Next is Rouge.

21:24.170 --> 21:26.300
Then does that mean...

21:26.300 --> 21:28.550
We're the lowest ranking Lapis!

21:28.550 --> 21:32.430
If you belong to a group, your rank will be
determined from the group total.

21:32.430 --> 21:34.390
It's what you call joke responsibility!

21:34.390 --> 21:35.560
You mean joint.

21:35.560 --> 21:41.980
I see... But if it just means we have to eat
and take baths later, that doesn't seem so...

21:41.980 --> 21:44.740
Yes... Well...

21:44.740 --> 21:48.160
You've got a point, but...

21:48.160 --> 21:52.290
We all received failing grades last term.

21:52.290 --> 21:56.870
And, well... If we fail again this term...

21:58.210 --> 22:00.750
We all get to be expelled together!

22:03.260 --> 22:04.300
Huh?

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.880 --> 22:30.780
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.780 --> 22:39.480
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.480 --> 22:44.280
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.280 --> 22:49.080
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.080 --> 22:51.780
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.780 --> 22:55.530
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
zutto

22:55.530 --> 22:58.680
Forever

22:58.680 --> 23:00.780
It's shining stars

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.780 --> 23:05.580
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.580 --> 23:10.680
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.680 --> 23:15.630
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
watashi no planetarium

23:15.630 --> 23:19.230
My planetarium

23:19.230 --> 23:19.980
hora

23:19.230 --> 23:25.080
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:19.980 --> 23:25.080
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.080 --> 23:29.280
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
